            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esala ŵakwete ŵanace mcece, mena gawo galiji Yetelo, Meledi, Efele ni Yaloni. Meledi ŵamlombile Bitiya, mwanace jwamkongwe jwa Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo, ŵakongwewo ŵakwete cilu ni ŵaŵelece mwanace jwamkongwe lina lyakwe Miliyamu, ni ŵane ŵaŵili ŵacalume mena gawo galiji Shamayi ni Ishiba. Ishiba ŵaliji babagwe Eshitemowa. Meledi ŵalombele soni jwamkongwe jwa lukosyo lwa Yuda nipo ŵaŵelece najo ŵanace ŵatatu, mena gawo galiji Yaledi ŵaŵataŵile msinda wa Gedoli, Hebele ŵaŵataŵile msinda wa Soko ni Yekutiyele ŵaŵataŵile msinda wa Sanowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17+1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17",
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
